  Talk:
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1812e1b614eb4f5da2ad5be5808f804f, type: 2}
      Text: That driftwood was wetter than it looked.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4083b8134ca747f68837268d2bd45653, type: 2}
      Text: It is burning, is it not? Leave it be.
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b26b6a8c5154f86b2ea4b17e2511e1f, type: 2}
      Text: My mother lit one on this very spot.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f8985f554ea4c9c84e248e9b8be1859, type: 2}
      Text: Everybody lit one on this very spot.
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b26b6a8c5154f86b2ea4b17e2511e1f, type: 2}
      Text: Then it is a good spot.
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4083b8134ca747f68837268d2bd45653, type: 2}
      Text: Tide is on the turn. Hear it?
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1812e1b614eb4f5da2ad5be5808f804f, type: 2}
      Text: I hear my supper settling.
  - Lines:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f8985f554ea4c9c84e248e9b8be1859, type: 2}
      Text: Who is bringing the wood next time?
    - Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1812e1b614eb4f5da2ad5be5808f804f, type: 2}
      Text: Whoever asks.
  WaitsOn: 
